  "description": "Reporter Hwang In-Chan and famous novelist Ki Tae-Beom meet by chance in a luxury hotel bathroom. \n\n*‘… Dangerous.'* \n\nIn-Chan instinctively senses danger and wants to avoid him, but for some reason this novelist keeps pulling him in... \n\nYou can run, but you can never escape from Ki Tae-Beom's contract! What will Hwang In-Chan's life be like? \n\n(Source: KakaoPage) \n\n*Note:\n\\- This work is the winner of the 2017 Kakao Page Mentoring Manhwa Production Support Contest.\n\\- Includes eight extra chapters.*",
